Package: mirrorslope
Title: Mirror Slope Plots for Two-Arm Clinical Trial Data
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Adam", "Sullivan", email = "asullivan@capricor.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Kati", "Maharry", email = "kmaharry@capricor.com",
           role = "aut"))
Description: Creates mirrored slope plots comparing two treatment arms over a
    single observation interval. Both arms share a common x-axis and converge
    at a central endpoint, making the between-arm gap the primary visual
    quantity. Returns standard 'ggplot2' objects for full extensibility.
